I'm back to scouting for a third time to stay.

16
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:24,720
The first was a boy,

17
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:27,840
The second when my boys were old enough to join

18
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:32,840
And now, as I approach military retirement, I want to continue to serve among great people.

19
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:37,320
I'm pouring over the blog, listening to the podcast, and I brought the book to read at

20
