It's 150 Thoughts on Scouting that were originally published on our Twitter feed as tweets.

31
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:13,240
So it's a quick read, and it just came to me after getting Jim's message that you

32
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:16,920
know you could take this book. actually, you can get through the book probably in

33
00:02:16,920 --> 00:02:19,400
about 15 minutes.

34
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:22,640
I mean, if you take a break, right,

35
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:26,840
It's a quick one- to check off the reading list and you can walk around and tell people

36
